; F1.3's two pins live beside each other because both read the log contract
; rather than the serving path.
;
; [field_sets] drives the real engines over stub providers and a stub fetcher,
; so no socket is opened and no provider key is read. [source_discipline] reads
; the library and binary sources, which is why its stanza declares both trees as
; inputs: a source guard whose files are not inputs to the action can pass by
; scanning nothing after a build layout change.

(test
 (name field_sets)
 (libraries seekwright alcotest test_support))

(test
 (name source_discipline)
 (libraries alcotest test_support)
 (deps
  (source_tree ../../lib)
  (source_tree ../../bin)))
